      },
      "text": "3-Day Uyuni Salt Flat Jeep Tour: Bolivia’s Lagoons, Geysers and Volcanoes"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f561695912038feac313dae20dab32d82b3145def3e735a0979538322b411a03",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-46f95238a290459398b4283e1f15ccba",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "This group jeep tour crosses south-western Bolivia to reach the Uyuni Salt Flat. Over 3 days, you’ll see Laguna Verde and Licancabur volcano, the Salvador Dalí Valley, the Polques hot springs, the Sol de Mañana geysers, Laguna Colorada, high-altitude lagoons, the Stone Tree, Ollagüe volcano and the Uyuni Salt Flat itself."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:formatLabel:e904c9ccfa425ff0",
      "field": "formatLabel",
      "sourceTextSha256": "33258aba1b86284a3adfe907d92aa782f1b9d9a36188bb9aa9cd934b46bf53b3",
      "provenance": {
