        "runId": "ada-en-46f95238a290459398b4283e1f15ccba",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "starts at Hito Cajones on the Chile–Bolivia border and ends in Uyuni or San Pedro de Atacama"
    },
